{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-plugin-labels#card-zh","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-plugin-labels","commit":"8fb942d71475cb4603084d62eeb778bd9720ad16","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 插件中文标签为 DSH 桌面版 Web 插件，在宿主侧接入官方插件元数据、插件包卡片和技能目录，把已缓存的中文名称、说明与分类直接显示在原有位置。它可通过 DSH 的 LLM 服务为新安装插件和技能补充中文标签，支持手动编辑、指定重翻、分类、导入导出，并提供本机汇总文档生成。插件标签和技能说明分别保存在 DSH_HOME 的缓存文件中，管理通过 loopback HTTP API 完成；自动补齐可由环境变量关闭。适合希望用中文浏览已安装插件和技能目录、并集中维护标签的 DSH 桌面用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2115-2122","lib/index.js:2197-2241"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-plugin-labels#card-en","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-plugin-labels","commit":"8fb942d71475cb4603084d62eeb778bd9720ad16","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Plugin Labels shows cached Chinese names, descriptions, and categories on the DSH desktop Web Plugins page, package cards, and skill menu. It uses DSH translation services and provides local routes for editing, classification, and import/export. Labels are cached under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2115-2122","lib/index.js:2197-2241"]}
