{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-plugin-labels#feature-translate","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-plugin-labels","commit":"8fb942d71475cb4603084d62eeb778bd9720ad16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 插件中文标签 的功能「自动补充插件标签」：启动后延迟执行翻译，并周期性检查新技能；翻译由 DSH 的 LLM 服务完成，结果写入本地缓存，可通过设置关闭自动流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1739-1773"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-plugin-labels#feature-manage","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-plugin-labels","commit":"8fb942d71475cb4603084d62eeb778bd9720ad16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 插件中文标签 的功能「标签与分类管理 API」：宿主注册 loopback HTTP 路由，可列出、翻译、手改、导入导出插件标签，也可列出、翻译和手改技能说明并补齐分类。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2197-2241"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-plugin-labels#feature-summary","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-plugin-labels","commit":"8fb942d71475cb4603084d62eeb778bd9720ad16","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 插件中文标签 的功能「生成本地汇总文档」：写入缓存或自动处理完成后，插件会更新插件及技能汇总文档；文档由本机标签缓存和已安装清单生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1181"]}
